  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -20,19 +20,23 @@ If you or your organization would like to contribute or become a sponsor, please\n \n This is expected to be the final release of the 4.2 branch.\n \n+This is the last release branch with official support for macOS 10.14 and 10.15.\n+\n === Bug Fixes\n \n // The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n \n-// * wssalink:2025-04[] {notable}\n-// Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n-// wsbuglink:xxx[].\n-// cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n-// Fixed in master: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-4.4: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-4.2: xxx\n+* wssalink:2025-04[] {notable}\n+MONGO dissector infinite loop.\n+wsbuglink:20724[].\n+cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n+// Fixed in master: 1ec4709cab\n+// Fixed in release-4.6: fdb3823962\n+// Fixed in release-4.4: ac504cd5de\n+// Fixed in release-4.2: 513e5d4972\n // CVSS AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\n-// CWE-824\n+// CWE-835\n+// * Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-09-22-11446760871.pcap. wsbuglink:20724[].\n \n The following bugs have been fixed:\n \n@@ -41,6 +45,12 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark grabs your ID at 3 am, goes to Waffle House, and insults people.\n \n+* Using wslog parameters in command line applications leads to freeing invalid memory. wsbuglink:20500[].\n+* On macOS a lower resolution Wireshark icon is displayed in the App Switcher and Launchpad. wsbuglink:20544[].\n+// misdissection, but no crash.\n+* Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-08-06-10932469456.pcap. wsbuglink:20666[].\n+* Encoding on NAS5GS- NASDL Transport Message-Multiple Container contains inconsistencies. wsbuglink:20679[].\n+\n === New and Updated Features\n \n There are no new or updated features in this release.\n@@ -57,9 +67,15 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n === Updated Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// rg -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.2.13.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n+// rg -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.2.14.. | rg packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+H.248E\n+HTTP2\n+IAX2\n+MONGO\n+NAS-5GS\n+XML\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
